            "notes": "[Iridescent Iris](item_b7fb28ef-ce82-416b-8693-01c274f8df4e) Gives us 20% more AP and 10% CDR. These are prime stats for this build as the faster you can use your abilities the better your armor sustain with [Lum\u00e9riCo Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8) along with healing and killing.\n\nI added [Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016) and [Energized Bracers](item_f83a1d9e-91f8-4d2c-bd62-c673b8d9fd2e) bracers here incase you feel as though you need a little more sustain. However I rarely pick these up over [Iridescent Iris](item_b7fb28ef-ce82-416b-8693-01c274f8df4e).",
