            "created_at": "2025-09-30T22:05:17.155794+00:00",
            "notes": "**Time for the hunt!** Pick up [Ethereal Excision](item_a2359da3-1aa5-406f-a82f-4a0bd66266ac) and sell everything but [Lum\u00e9riCo Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8). We then pick up [Superflexor](item_580b77b4-0d63-469b-99a8-5372c55dfc1b)[Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) and [Vanadium Injection](item_57953fbc-11ff-4e92-9928-fc59b7be668f).\n\nNow you can harass the enemy backline as you have solid self sustain with **Lifesteal**. Utilize [Ethereal Excision](item_a2359da3-1aa5-406f-a82f-4a0bd66266ac) movement speed to engage the enemy by right clicking their heads. Your damage orbs and secondary fire both give you Lifesteal, while [Cross-Orbal](item_e567bb63-527f-4c72-8ba1-dc59be1a0dc1) also heals you and damages enemies.\n\n**Make sure to not use your ultimate once fully charged**",
